Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.15,0:19:02.19,LIVE Ripple Jp,,0,0,0,,守り{\3c&H0203E4&}たい {\3c&H0AD8A6&}人がいる
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.35,0:19:05.36,LIVE Ripple Jp,,0,0,0,,守り{\3c&H0AD8A6&}たい {\3c&H0203E4&}居場所が
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.55,0:19:11.42,LIVE Zeal Jp,,0,0,0,,守り{\3c&H0AD8A6&}たい {\3c&HEFA639&}全てのために 想い {\3c&H0203E4&}掲げ {\3c&H0AD8A6&}走れ！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.85,0:19:15.30,LIVE Zeal Jp,,0,0,0,,奪わせ{\3c&HEFA639&}ない {\3c&H0AD8A6&}絶対
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.45,0:19:18.42,LIVE Ripple Jp,,0,0,0,,結ばれてく 決意固く
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.58,0:19:20.96,LIVE Zeal Jp,,0,0,0,,私たちは{\3c&HEFA639&}プリン{\3c&H0AD8A6&}セス！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.33,0:19:27.56,LIVE Zeal Jp,,0,0,0,,歌え！{\3c&HEFA639&}声の限り {\3c&H0AD8A6&}夢を振り絞って
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.80,0:19:33.99,LIVE Zeal Jp,,0,0,0,,私たちの{\3c&HEFA639&}一生懸命を {\3c&H0AD8A6&}刮目せよ！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.19,0:19:40.26,LIVE Zeal Jp,,0,0,0,,歌え！ {\3c&HEFA639&}何があっても {\3c&H0AD8A6&}決して諦めない
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.46,0:19:50.13,LIVE Zeal Jp,,0,0,0,,奇跡を{\3c&HEFA639&}必然に 闇を{\3c&H0AD8A6&}切り裂け
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.15,0:19:02.19,LIVE Ripple,,0,0,0,,有想要{\3c&H0203E4&}守护{\3c&H0AD8A6&}的人
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.35,0:19:05.36,LIVE Ripple,,0,0,0,,有想要{\3c&H0AD8A6&}守护{\3c&H0203E4&}的家
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.55,0:19:11.42,LIVE Zeal,,0,0,0,,为了{\3c&H0AD8A6&}保护{\3c&HEFA639&}一切 斗志 {\3c&H0203E4&}昂扬 {\3c&H0AD8A6&}疾跑！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.85,0:19:15.30,LIVE Zeal,,0,0,0,,绝不{\3c&HEFA639&}让你{\3c&H0AD8A6&}夺走
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.45,0:19:18.42,LIVE Ripple,,0,0,0,,友谊相伴 决心坚定
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.58,0:19:20.96,LIVE Zeal,,0,0,0,,我们{\3c&HEFA639&}是{\3c&H0AD8A6&}公主！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.33,0:19:27.56,LIVE Zeal,,0,0,0,,歌唱吧！{\3c&HEFA639&}极尽我们声音{\3c&H0AD8A6&}与梦想的极限
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.80,0:19:33.99,LIVE Zeal,,0,0,0,,重新认识到{\3c&HEFA639&}我们的{\3c&H0AD8A6&}竭尽全力吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.19,0:19:40.26,LIVE Zeal,,0,0,0,,歌唱吧！{\3c&HEFA639&}无论前路困境 {\3c&H0AD8A6&}绝对不会放弃
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.46,0:19:50.13,LIVE Zeal,,0,0,0,,化腐朽{\3c&HEFA639&}为神奇 {\3c&H0AD8A6&}开辟黑暗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.49,0:19:54.88,Ripple,,0,0,0,,-喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.07,0:20:03.70,Ripple,,0,0,0,,-喝!!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.48,0:20:12.34,Ripple,,0,0,0,,冲啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.18,0:20:33.63,Ripple,,0,0,0,,成功了？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.89,0:20:36.78,Meteor,,0,0,0,,哦哟！能不能别竖Flag啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.05,0:20:38.96,Zeal,,0,0,0,,别开玩笑了！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.45,0:20:42.44,Zeal,,0,0,0,,我可不认为刚才那样就打败他了...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.13,0:20:53.46,Meteor,,0,0,0,,果然！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.24,0:20:59.00,Ripple,,0,0,0,,你究竟是谁？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.73,0:21:08.58,Default2,,0,0,0,,花骑士·赤诚
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.73,0:21:08.58,Default2,,220,0,0,,{\fs50}Sincere
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.48,0:21:11.02,Ripple,,0,0,0,,-啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.98,0:21:24.91,Ripple,,0,0,0,,纳比尤 刚才的女生呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.15,0:21:27.17,Default,,0,0,0,,托你们的福 音悦力量已经回归了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.44,0:21:29.86,Default,,0,0,0,,只要休息一下 应该就能恢复精神
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.80,0:21:32.67,Ripple,,0,0,0,,是吗... 太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.95,0:21:35.48,Default,,0,0,0,,可是 那个怪人 究竟是...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.38,0:21:39.51,Meteor,,0,0,0,,又是新的敌人吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.61,0:21:49.10,Zeal,,0,0,0,,不仅仅是赤红女王呢
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.13,0:21:53.15,Zeal,,0,0,0,,想要扰乱爱丽丝比亚和平的...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.76,0:21:57.84,Ripple,,0,0,0,,花骑士·赤诚...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.41,0:23:37.07,Meteor,,0,0,0,,花骑士 好强！太强了！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.23,0:23:38.74,Zeal,,0,0,0,,那种压力是什么!?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.92,0:23:41.90,Ripple,,0,0,0,,不要放弃！我们可是公主啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.06,0:23:44.31,Ripple,,0,0,0,,下集 高歌吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.69,0:23:47.48,Meteor,,0,0,0,,是啊！上吧 我们上吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.64,0:23:49.37,Default,,0,0,0,,你们看机战作品了？
